the European Institute for Peace, explains: \"The real challenge for the new president is to broaden his base. Because so far he has relied exclusively on loyalists from Idlib, who are very conservative.\" And even after the overwhelming victory, the new government does not control the entire territory: in the south, the Israeli army has extended its occupation to the Golan Heights, while in the north, the Turks are bombing Kurdish-controlled areas on a massive scale. Syria is still unstable. However, the hopes and expectations of Syrians following more than 50 years of Assad rule are high. #documentary #dwdocumentary #dwdocs #syria #assadregime ______ DW Documentary gives you knowledge beyond the headlines. Watch top documentaries from German broadcasters and international production companies. Meet intriguing people, travel to distant lands, get a look behind the complexities of daily life and build a deeper understanding of current affairs and global events. Subscribe and explore the world around you with DW Documentary. Subscribe to: ‬ ⮞ DW Documentary (English): https://www.youtube.com/dwdocumentary ⮞ DW Documental (Spanish): https://www.youtube.com/dwdocumental ⮞ DW Documentary وثائقية دي دبليو (Arabic): https://www.youtube.com/dwdocarabia ⮞ DW Documentary हिन्दी (Hindi): https://www.youtube.com/dwdochindi ⮞ DW Doku (German): https://www.youtube.com/dwdoku For more visit: http://www.dw.com/en/tv/docfilm/s-3610 Follow DW Documentary on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/dwdocumentary/ Follow DW Documental on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/dwdocumental We kindly ask viewers to read and stick to the DW netiquette policy on our channel: https://p.dw.com/p/MF1G","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/USjVcpYzcO8/maxresdefault.jpg","category":"Documentaries","city":"","country":"","channel":"DW Documentary","channelTitle":"DW Documentary","channelId":"UCW39zufHfsuGgpLviKh297Q","badge":"DOCUMENTARY","publishedAt":"2025-09-20T16:00:59Z","viewCount":502049,"duration